{
  "name": "Dark Sister's Scorn",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 60 feet hits you or your bonded familiar with an attack or forces you to make a Saving Throw, you can use your Reaction to curse that creature. The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failure, it is subject to one of the effects of the Bestow Curse spell until the start of its next turn.</p><p>If the target is already under the effect of Bestow Curse, it stacks with this feature as long as you choose a different curse effect.</p>",
